{"seq":2,"slug":"android-room-workmanager","title":"Android Room 与 WorkManager","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/mobile-offline-sync/implementation/android-room-workmanager","wordCount":923,"readingTime":4,"html":"<h1 id=\"android-room-与-workmanager\">Android Room 与 WorkManager</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>Android 离线同步基于 Jetpack 双核组件：Room（响应式本地 DB + 编译时 SQL 校验 + AutoMigration）和 WorkManager（保证执行 + 约束条件 + 指数退避）。核心模式是 Mutation Queue——用户写入同时落业务表和队列表（单事务原子性），WorkManager 在网络可用时消费队列推送变更，Pull Worker 定时拉取远端更新。</p>\n<h2 id=\"android-离线同步的官方技术栈\">Android 离线同步的官方技术栈</h2><p>Android 平台不像 iOS 提供内置的跨设备同步服务（Firebase 是可选第三方方案）。官方推荐的离线优先架构基于两个核心 Jetpack 组件：<strong>Room</strong> 作为本地持久层（响应式查询、编译时 SQL 校验、自动迁移），<strong>WorkManager</strong> 作为后台同步调度器（保证执行、约束条件、指数退避）。两者配合构成完整的离线写入 → 后台同步链路。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TB&#10;    UI[Jetpack Compose UI]&#10;    VM[ViewModel]&#10;    REPO[Repository]&#10;    ROOM[(Room Database)]&#10;    MQ[Mutation Queue 表]&#10;    WM[WorkManager]&#10;    API[Remote API]&#10;&#10;    UI --&gt; VM&#10;    VM --&gt; REPO&#10;    REPO --&gt; ROOM&#10;    REPO --&gt; MQ&#10;    MQ --&gt; WM&#10;    WM --&gt; API&#10;    API --&gt;|成功| MQ&#10;    ROOM --&gt;|&quot;Flow&lt;List&gt;&quot;| VM\">flowchart TB\n    UI[Jetpack Compose UI]\n    VM[ViewModel]\n    REPO[Repository]\n    ROOM[(Room Database)]\n    MQ[Mutation Queue 表]\n    WM[WorkManager]\n    API[Remote API]\n\n    UI --&gt; VM\n    VM --&gt; REPO\n    REPO --&gt; ROOM\n    REPO --&gt; MQ\n    MQ --&gt; WM\n    WM --&gt; API\n    API --&gt;|成功| MQ\n    ROOM --&gt;|\"Flow&lt;List&gt;\"| VM</pre><p>这套架构的核心原则：<strong>UI 永远从 Room 读取，用户写入同时落库和入队列，WorkManager 在约束满足时消费队列推送到服务端</strong>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"room-响应式本地数据库\">Room：响应式本地数据库</h2><p>Room 2.6（2025-2026 stable）在离线同步场景的关键能力：</p>\n<h3 id=\"响应式查询驱动-ui\">响应式查询驱动 UI</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"kotlin\" data-code=\"@Entity(tableName = &quot;notes&quot;)&#10;data class NoteEntity(&#10;    @PrimaryKey val id: String = UUID.randomUUID().toString(),&#10;    val title: String,&#10;    val content: String,&#10;    val updatedAt: Long = System.currentTimeMillis(),&#10;    val syncState: SyncState = SyncState.PENDING&#10;)&#10;&#10;enum class SyncState { PENDING, SYNCING, SYNCED, CONFLICT }&#10;&#10;@Dao&#10;interface NoteDao {&#10;    @Query(&quot;SELECT * FROM notes ORDER BY updatedAt DESC&quot;)&#10;    fun observeAll(): Flow&lt;List&lt;NoteEntity&gt;&gt;&#10;&#10;    @Query(&quot;SELECT * FROM notes WHERE syncState = :state&quot;)&#10;    suspend fun getByState(state: SyncState): List&lt;NoteEntity&gt;&#10;&#10;    @Insert(onConflict = OnConflictStrategy.REPLACE)&#10;    suspend fun upsert(note: NoteEntity)&#10;&#10;    @Transaction&#10;    suspend fun updateWithSync(note: NoteEntity) {&#10;        upsert(note.copy(syncState = SyncState.PENDING, updatedAt = System.currentTimeMillis()))&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>@Entity(tableName = \"notes\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>data class NoteEntity(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    @PrimaryKey val id: String = UUID.randomUUID().toString(),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    val title: String,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    val content: String,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    val updatedAt: Long = System.currentTimeMillis(),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    val syncState: SyncState = SyncState.PENDING</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>enum class SyncState { PENDING, SYNCING, SYNCED, CONFLICT }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>@Dao</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>interface NoteDao {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    @Query(\"SELECT * FROM notes ORDER BY updatedAt DESC\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    fun observeAll(): Flow&#x3C;List&#x3C;NoteEntity>></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    @Query(\"SELECT * FROM notes WHERE syncState = :state\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    suspend fun getByState(state: SyncState): List&#x3C;NoteEntity></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    @Insert(onConflict = OnConflictStrategy.REPLACE)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    suspend fun upsert(note: NoteEntity)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    @Transaction</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    suspend fun updateWithSync(note: NoteEntity) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        upsert(note.copy(syncState = SyncState.PENDING, updatedAt = System.currentTimeMillis()))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>Flow&lt;List&lt;NoteEntity&gt;&gt;</code> 的响应式特性确保：用户写入本地 → Room 自动通知所有观察者 → UI 即时更新，整个过程不经过网络。</p>\n<h3 id=\"automigration-安全的-schema-演进\">AutoMigration：安全的 Schema 演进</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"kotlin\" data-code=\"@Database(&#10;    entities = [NoteEntity::class],&#10;    version = 3,&#10;    autoMigrations = [&#10;        AutoMigration(from = 1, to = 2),  // 新增 syncState 列&#10;        AutoMigration(from = 2, to = 3, spec = Migration2To3::class)&#10;    ]&#10;)&#10;abstract class AppDatabase : RoomDatabase() {&#10;    abstract fun noteDao(): NoteDao&#10;}&#10;&#10;@RenameColumn(tableName = &quot;notes&quot;, fromColumnName = &quot;body&quot;, toColumnName = &quot;content&quot;)&#10;class Migration2To3 : AutoMigrationSpec\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>@Database(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    entities = [NoteEntity::class],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    version = 3,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    autoMigrations = [</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        AutoMigration(from = 1, to = 2),  // 新增 syncState 列</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        AutoMigration(from = 2, to = 3, spec = Migration2To3::class)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    ]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>abstract class AppDatabase : RoomDatabase() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    abstract fun noteDao(): NoteDao</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>@RenameColumn(tableName = \"notes\", fromColumnName = \"body\", toColumnName = \"content\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>class Migration2To3 : AutoMigrationSpec</span></span></code></pre></div><p>AutoMigration 处理简单的加列、加表、重命名。复杂迁移（数据转换、拆表）仍需手写 <code>Migration</code> 对象。</p>\n<h2 id=\"mutation-queue-离线写入队列\">Mutation Queue：离线写入队列</h2><p>离线写入的核心模式是<strong>Mutation Queue</strong>——一个独立的 Room 表，记录所有待同步的写操作：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"kotlin\" data-code=\"@Entity(tableName = &quot;mutation_queue&quot;)&#10;data class PendingMutation(&#10;    @PrimaryKey(autoGenerate = true) val id: Long = 0,&#10;    val operationType: String,    // INSERT / UPDATE / DELETE&#10;    val targetTable: String,&#10;    val entityId: String,&#10;    val payloadJson: String,&#10;    val createdAt: Long = System.currentTimeMillis(),&#10;    val retryCount: Int = 0&#10;)&#10;&#10;@Dao&#10;interface MutationDao {&#10;    @Query(&quot;SELECT * FROM mutation_queue ORDER BY createdAt ASC&quot;)&#10;    suspend fun getAllPending(): List&lt;PendingMutation&gt;&#10;&#10;    @Insert&#10;    suspend fun enqueue(mutation: PendingMutation)&#10;&#10;    @Delete&#10;    suspend fun dequeue(mutation: PendingMutation)&#10;&#10;    @Query(&quot;UPDATE mutation_queue SET retryCount = retryCount + 1 WHERE id = :id&quot;)&#10;    suspend fun incrementRetry(id: Long)&#10;&#10;    @Query(&quot;SELECT COUNT(*) FROM mutation_queue&quot;)&#10;    fun observePendingCount(): Flow&lt;Int&gt;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>@Entity(tableName = \"mutation_queue\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>data class PendingMutation(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    @PrimaryKey(autoGenerate = true) val id: Long = 0,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    val operationType: String,    // INSERT / UPDATE / DELETE</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    val targetTable: String,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    val entityId: String,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    val payloadJson: String,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    val createdAt: Long = System.currentTimeMillis(),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    val retryCount: Int = 0</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>@Dao</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>interface MutationDao {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    @Query(\"SELECT * FROM mutation_queue ORDER BY createdAt ASC\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    suspend fun getAllPending(): List&#x3C;PendingMutation></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    @Insert</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    suspend fun enqueue(mutation: PendingMutation)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    @Delete</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    suspend fun dequeue(mutation: PendingMutation)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    @Query(\"UPDATE mutation_queue SET retryCount = retryCount + 1 WHERE id = :id\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    suspend fun incrementRetry(id: Long)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    @Query(\"SELECT COUNT(*) FROM mutation_queue\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    fun observePendingCount(): Flow&#x3C;Int></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>写入操作在单个事务中完成——确保业务数据更新和队列入队的原子性：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"kotlin\" data-code=\"class NoteRepository(&#10;    private val db: AppDatabase,&#10;    private val json: Json&#10;) {&#10;    suspend fun updateNote(note: NoteEntity) {&#10;        db.withTransaction {&#10;            db.noteDao().updateWithSync(note)&#10;            db.mutationDao().enqueue(&#10;                PendingMutation(&#10;                    operationType = &quot;UPDATE&quot;,&#10;                    targetTable = &quot;notes&quot;,&#10;                    entityId = note.id,&#10;                    payloadJson = json.encodeToString(note)&#10;                )&#10;            )&#10;        }&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>class NoteRepository(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    private val db: AppDatabase,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    private val json: Json</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    suspend fun updateNote(note: NoteEntity) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        db.withTransaction {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            db.noteDao().updateWithSync(note)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            db.mutationDao().enqueue(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                PendingMutation(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                    operationType = \"UPDATE\",</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                    targetTable = \"notes\",</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                    entityId = note.id,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                    payloadJson = json.encodeToString(note)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                )</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            )</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"workmanager-可靠的后台同步调度\">WorkManager：可靠的后台同步调度</h2><p>WorkManager 保证任务最终执行——即使 App 被 kill 或设备重启。这对离线同步至关重要：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"kotlin\" data-code=\"class SyncWorker(&#10;    context: Context,&#10;    params: WorkerParameters,&#10;    private val db: AppDatabase,&#10;    private val api: SyncApi&#10;) : CoroutineWorker(context, params) {&#10;&#10;    override suspend fun doWork(): Result {&#10;        val pending = db.mutationDao().getAllPending()&#10;        if (pending.isEmpty()) return Result.success()&#10;&#10;        for (mutation in pending) {&#10;            try {&#10;                val response = api.pushMutation(mutation)&#10;                if (response.isSuccessful) {&#10;                    db.withTransaction {&#10;                        db.mutationDao().dequeue(mutation)&#10;                        db.noteDao().upsert(&#10;                            /* 更新 syncState = SYNCED */&#10;                        )&#10;                    }&#10;                } else if (response.code() == 409) {&#10;                    // 服务端检测到冲突&#10;                    handleConflict(mutation, response)&#10;                }&#10;            } catch (e: IOException) {&#10;                db.mutationDao().incrementRetry(mutation.id)&#10;                return Result.retry()&#10;            }&#10;        }&#10;        return Result.success()&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>class SyncWorker(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    context: Context,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    params: WorkerParameters,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    private val db: AppDatabase,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    private val api: SyncApi</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>) : CoroutineWorker(context, params) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    override suspend fun doWork(): Result {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        val pending = db.mutationDao().getAllPending()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        if (pending.isEmpty()) return Result.success()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        for (mutation in pending) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            try {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                val response = api.pushMutation(mutation)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                if (response.isSuccessful) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                    db.withTransaction {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                        db.mutationDao().dequeue(mutation)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                        db.noteDao().upsert(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                            /* 更新 syncState = SYNCED */</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                        )</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                } else if (response.code() == 409) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                    // 服务端检测到冲突</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                    handleConflict(mutation, response)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            } catch (e: IOException) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                db.mutationDao().incrementRetry(mutation.id)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                return Result.retry()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        return Result.success()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"调度策略配置\">调度策略配置</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>约束条件</th>\n<th>作用</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>NetworkType.CONNECTED</code></td>\n<td>有网络时才执行</td>\n<td>所有同步任务</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>NetworkType.UNMETERED</code></td>\n<td>仅 Wi-Fi</td>\n<td>大附件上传</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>requiresCharging()</code></td>\n<td>充电时</td>\n<td>全量备份同步</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>requiresBatteryNotLow()</code></td>\n<td>电量充足</td>\n<td>批量历史同步</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"kotlin\" data-code=\"fun Context.scheduleSyncWork() {&#10;    val constraints = Constraints.Builder()&#10;        .setRequiredNetworkType(NetworkType.CONNECTED)&#10;        .build()&#10;&#10;    val request = OneTimeWorkRequestBuilder&lt;SyncWorker&gt;()&#10;        .setConstraints(constraints)&#10;        .setBackoffCriteria(&#10;            BackoffPolicy.EXPONENTIAL,&#10;            WorkRequest.MIN_BACKOFF_MILLIS,  // 10s&#10;            TimeUnit.MILLISECONDS&#10;        )&#10;        .setExpedited(OutOfQuotaPolicy.RUN_AS_NON_EXPEDITED_WORK_REQUEST)&#10;        .build()&#10;&#10;    WorkManager.getInstance(this).enqueueUniqueWork(&#10;        &quot;sync_mutations&quot;,&#10;        ExistingWorkPolicy.KEEP,&#10;        request&#10;    )&#10;}&#10;&#10;// 周期性拉取远端变更&#10;fun Context.schedulePeriodicPull() {&#10;    val request = PeriodicWorkRequestBuilder&lt;PullWorker&gt;(&#10;        repeatInterval = 15, TimeUnit.MINUTES,&#10;        flexInterval = 5, TimeUnit.MINUTES&#10;    )&#10;        .setConstraints(&#10;            Constraints.Builder()&#10;                .setRequiredNetworkType(NetworkType.CONNECTED)&#10;                .build()&#10;        )&#10;        .build()&#10;&#10;    WorkManager.getInstance(this).enqueueUniquePeriodicWork(&#10;        &quot;periodic_pull&quot;,&#10;        ExistingPeriodicWorkPolicy.KEEP,&#10;        request&#10;    )&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>fun Context.scheduleSyncWork() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    val constraints = Constraints.Builder()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        .setRequiredNetworkType(NetworkType.CONNECTED)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        .build()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    val request = OneTimeWorkRequestBuilder&#x3C;SyncWorker>()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        .setConstraints(constraints)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        .setBackoffCriteria(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            BackoffPolicy.EXPONENTIAL,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            WorkRequest.MIN_BACKOFF_MILLIS,  // 10s</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            TimeUnit.MILLISECONDS</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        )</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        .setExpedited(OutOfQuotaPolicy.RUN_AS_NON_EXPEDITED_WORK_REQUEST)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        .build()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    WorkManager.getInstance(this).enqueueUniqueWork(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        \"sync_mutations\",</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        ExistingWorkPolicy.KEEP,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        request</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    )</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 周期性拉取远端变更</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>fun Context.schedulePeriodicPull() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    val request = PeriodicWorkRequestBuilder&#x3C;PullWorker>(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        repeatInterval = 15, TimeUnit.MINUTES,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        flexInterval = 5, TimeUnit.MINUTES</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    )</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        .setConstraints(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            Constraints.Builder()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                .setRequiredNetworkType(NetworkType.CONNECTED)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                .build()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        )</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        .build()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    WorkManager.getInstance(this).enqueueUniquePeriodicWork(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        \"periodic_pull\",</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        ExistingPeriodicWorkPolicy.KEEP,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        request</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    )</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"双向同步-push-pull\">双向同步：Push + Pull</h2><p>完整的双向同步需要两个方向的数据流：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;    subgraph &quot;Push(本地 → 远端)&quot;&#10;        MQ2[Mutation Queue] --&gt; SW[SyncWorker]&#10;        SW --&gt; API2[POST /api/sync/push]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph &quot;Pull(远端 → 本地)&quot;&#10;        PW[PullWorker] --&gt; API3[GET /api/sync/pull?since=cursor]&#10;        API3 --&gt; MERGE[合并到 Room]&#10;    end\">flowchart LR\n    subgraph \"Push(本地 → 远端)\"\n        MQ2[Mutation Queue] --&gt; SW[SyncWorker]\n        SW --&gt; API2[POST /api/sync/push]\n    end\n    subgraph \"Pull(远端 → 本地)\"\n        PW[PullWorker] --&gt; API3[GET /api/sync/pull?since=cursor]\n        API3 --&gt; MERGE[合并到 Room]\n    end</pre><p>Pull 同步的关键是 cursor 管理——本地持久化上次成功拉取的 cursor（存在 DataStore 或独立 Room 表中），每次拉取时传给服务端：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"kotlin\" data-code=\"class PullWorker(&#10;    context: Context,&#10;    params: WorkerParameters,&#10;    private val db: AppDatabase,&#10;    private val api: SyncApi,&#10;    private val cursorStore: DataStore&lt;Preferences&gt;&#10;) : CoroutineWorker(context, params) {&#10;&#10;    override suspend fun doWork(): Result {&#10;        val cursor = cursorStore.data.first()[SYNC_CURSOR_KEY] ?: &quot;&quot;&#10;&#10;        val response = api.pullChanges(since = cursor, limit = 200)&#10;        if (!response.isSuccessful) return Result.retry()&#10;&#10;        val payload = response.body() ?: return Result.success()&#10;&#10;        db.withTransaction {&#10;            for (change in payload.changes) {&#10;                when (change.type) {&#10;                    &quot;UPSERT&quot; -&gt; db.noteDao().upsert(change.toEntity())&#10;                    &quot;DELETE&quot; -&gt; db.noteDao().delete(change.entityId)&#10;                }&#10;            }&#10;        }&#10;&#10;        cursorStore.edit { it[SYNC_CURSOR_KEY] = payload.nextCursor }&#10;&#10;        if (payload.hasMore) {&#10;            // 还有更多变更，立即触发下一批&#10;            return Result.success()  // WorkManager 会重新调度&#10;        }&#10;        return Result.success()&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>class PullWorker(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    context: Context,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    params: WorkerParameters,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    private val db: AppDatabase,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    private val api: SyncApi,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    private val cursorStore: DataStore&#x3C;Preferences></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>) : CoroutineWorker(context, params) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    override suspend fun doWork(): Result {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        val cursor = cursorStore.data.first()[SYNC_CURSOR_KEY] ?: \"\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        val response = api.pullChanges(since = cursor, limit = 200)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        if (!response.isSuccessful) return Result.retry()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        val payload = response.body() ?: return Result.success()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        db.withTransaction {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            for (change in payload.changes) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                when (change.type) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                    \"UPSERT\" -> db.noteDao().upsert(change.toEntity())</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                    \"DELETE\" -> db.noteDao().delete(change.entityId)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        cursorStore.edit { it[SYNC_CURSOR_KEY] = payload.nextCursor }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        if (payload.hasMore) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            // 还有更多变更，立即触发下一批</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            return Result.success()  // WorkManager 会重新调度</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        return Result.success()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"connectivitymanager-集成\">ConnectivityManager 集成</h2><p>WorkManager 的网络约束由系统自动判断，但应用层可能需要更精细的控制。结合 <a href=\"../foundations/network-state-detection\">网络状态检测与切换</a> 中的自适应策略：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>强网络时：ExpeditedWork 立即同步</li>\n<li>弱网络时：降低批次大小，启用压缩</li>\n<li>计费网络时：仅同步关键数据，延迟非关键同步</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"测试策略\">测试策略</h2><p>Room + WorkManager 的离线同步代码可完全脱离真实网络测试：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>测试层</th>\n<th>工具</th>\n<th>验证点</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>DAO 测试</td>\n<td>Room in-memory DB</td>\n<td>事务原子性、查询正确性</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Repository 测试</td>\n<td>Fake DAO + Fake API</td>\n<td>队列入队逻辑、冲突处理</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Worker 测试</td>\n<td><code>TestWorkerBuilder</code></td>\n<td>成功/失败/重试路径</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>集成测试</td>\n<td><code>WorkManagerTestInitHelper</code></td>\n<td>端到端同步流程</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><a href=\"../operations/sync-monitoring-debugging\">同步监控与调试</a> 中讨论的可观测性方案同样适用于 Android——通过 WorkManager 的 <code>WorkInfo</code> 状态和自定义 metrics 实现生产环境的同步健康度追踪。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>Android 的 Room + WorkManager 组合为离线同步提供了完整的官方解决方案：Room 的响应式 Flow 驱动 UI 即时更新，Mutation Queue 保证写入不丢失，WorkManager 的约束调度确保后台推送在合适时机执行。AutoMigration 简化了 schema 演进，ConnectivityManager 集成实现自适应同步策略。测试友好的架构设计让离线同步逻辑可以完全脱离真实网络验证。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"Android Room 与 WorkManager","id":"android-room-与-workmanager"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"Android 离线同步的官方技术栈","id":"android-离线同步的官方技术栈"},{"level":2,"text":"Room：响应式本地数据库","id":"room-响应式本地数据库"},{"level":3,"text":"响应式查询驱动 UI","id":"响应式查询驱动-ui"},{"level":3,"text":"AutoMigration：安全的 Schema 演进","id":"automigration-安全的-schema-演进"},{"level":2,"text":"Mutation Queue：离线写入队列","id":"mutation-queue-离线写入队列"},{"level":2,"text":"WorkManager：可靠的后台同步调度","id":"workmanager-可靠的后台同步调度"},{"level":3,"text":"调度策略配置","id":"调度策略配置"},{"level":2,"text":"双向同步：Push + Pull","id":"双向同步-push-pull"},{"level":2,"text":"ConnectivityManager 集成","id":"connectivitymanager-集成"},{"level":2,"text":"测试策略","id":"测试策略"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"iOS Core Data 与 CloudKit 同步","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/mobile-offline-sync/implementation/ios-core-data-cloudkit"},"next":{"title":"跨平台同步方案","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/mobile-offline-sync/implementation/cross-platform-sync-solutions"}}